---
description: >-
  One representative railroad diagram in the neo family's dark theme, `neo-dark`. ABNF (`railroad-abnf-beta`): a five-way `/` alternation, an optional, `*( )` and `1*` repetition and a numeric range.
config:
  theme: neo-dark
---
railroad-abnf-beta
value = object / array / number / "true" / "null" ;
object = "{" [ member *( "," member ) ] "}" ;
number = [ "-" ] 1*DIGIT ;
DIGIT = %x30-39 ;
